      <p class="proj-status">Complete</p>
      <h2>Matmul Deepdive on ESP32-S3</h2>
      <p class="proj-dek">Does the $3 AI chip actually do AI?</p>
      <p class="summary">
        A ground-up benchmarking study of matrix multiplication on the ESP32-S3.
        Four implementations built from scratch, from the naive three-loop
        version to cache blocking and PIE SIMD, measured with cycle-accurate
        timing. The short answer: yes, but only up to a point, and the reason
        why is more interesting than the headline number.
      </p>
      <div class="proj-tags">
